From ff99d151bc020830df828e7307d02cf497022bbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:29:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: merge identical OptiFine sky images and document the
 fork

Add the merge_identical_optifine_sky_images global option. Identical images
of an OptiFine sky directory are merged into the first one in path order,
and the sky entries of that directory are changed to use it. Only whole file
names are replaced, and images that entries in other directories may refer
to are not merged.

Add a section to the README, after the original contents, that explains the
fork. Add the tools to build a baseline jar with many game versions.
Fix the clippy warnings of the previous commits.
